11
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:34,951
[Tsukasa] Work ended early,
so I thought I'd stop by.

12
00:00:37,829 --> 00:00:40,749
Uh. And what's all this, then?

13
00:00:40,832 --> 00:00:44,753
Sir, I was just being polite
greeting Miss Hoshino and her friends.

14
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:47,213
[Junta] It's nice to see you, Mr. Koganei.

15
00:00:47,881 --> 00:00:48,757
Huh?

16
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:52,594
