18
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:57,015
Yes, I've seen him around.

19
00:00:57,682 --> 00:01:00,810
Top performers tend to stand out
above the rest of the crowd.

20
00:01:00,894 --> 00:01:01,728
Oh.

21
00:01:01,811 --> 00:01:02,896
STUDENTS NOT WORTH NOTICING

22
