to walk me home from work.

32
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:32,717
Summer training starts tomorrow.
No break for me, I guess.

33
00:01:32,801 --> 00:01:35,345
-Same. I work every day.
-[chuckles]

34
00:01:36,721 --> 00:01:38,807
