95
00:05:39,255 --> 00:05:41,924
But come on, it was no more personal
than what they asked me.

96
00:05:42,508 --> 00:05:44,927
-[coughs]
-Yeah, I wouldn't wanna mess with you.

97
00:05:45,511 --> 00:05:46,888
[Saki] I love a sleepover.

98
00:05:48,222 --> 00:05:51,309
-Oh, what a cute cat figurine.
-[toy squeaks]

99
00:05:51,392 --> 00:05:53,811
