Anzu always takes care of her friends.

132
00:07:15,518 --> 00:07:17,228
Huh?

133
00:07:17,311 --> 00:07:18,229
Good night.

134
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:19,939
[Tsukasa] Good night.

135
00:07:21,315 --> 00:07:22,233
