will result in stomach distress.

144
00:07:43,629 --> 00:07:46,090
-[chuckles]
-What is your problem?

145
00:07:46,174 --> 00:07:48,885
-[grunts]
-That's it! Get out of my house!

146
00:07:48,968 --> 00:07:50,970
[Riri] Again with the window?

147
00:07:51,471 --> 00:07:53,389
[groans]

148
00:07:53,473 --> 00:07:55,224
Does your stomach still hurt?

149
00:07:55,725 --> 00:07:58,060
[weakly]
Yeah, but I'll be fine.

150
00:07:58,144 --> 00:07:59,395
Glad to hear that.

151
00:07:59,479 --> 00:08:03,024
