I can't believe it's summer break.

152
00:08:03,107 --> 00:08:05,401
Anzu, we need to hang out
all the time, okay?

153
00:08:06,235 --> 00:08:07,904
[yawns]

154
00:08:07,987 --> 00:08:11,407
That sounds good to me.
What do you wanna do?

155
00:08:11,491 --> 00:08:16,245
Hmm, it was pretty fun just hanging out
