162
00:08:31,969 --> 00:08:34,138
[boy 1] Saki Takamine is so hot.

163
00:08:34,222 --> 00:08:36,641
She's like, hands down,
the hottest girl in our school.

164
00:08:36,724 --> 00:08:40,061
-[boy 2] She's a total babe.
-[boy 3] Yeah, check out her rack.

165
00:08:40,144 --> 00:08:42,188
