from a young age.

166
00:08:42,271 --> 00:08:45,608
Everywhere I went,
people seem to take an interest in me.

167
00:08:45,691 --> 00:08:48,277
Saki, did you really turn down Ogawa?

168
00:08:48,361 --> 00:08:49,654
He's so cute.

169
00:08:49,737 --> 00:08:52,240
