196
00:09:58,055 --> 00:10:00,474
[gasps, chuckles]

197
00:10:02,810 --> 00:10:06,480
[Saki] From that day on,
Anzu and I were best friends.

198
00:10:06,564 --> 00:10:08,482
[birds chirping]

199
00:10:08,566 --> 00:10:09,984
TAKAMINE

200
00:10:10,067 --> 00:10:12,987
I can always feel guys
staring at me during PE.

201
00:10:13,571 --> 00:10:16,240
Oh! What you need is a bra
that'll make your boobs smaller.

202
00:10:17,241 --> 00:10:19,160
