my feelings.

203
00:10:19,243 --> 00:10:21,287
She never said I should be more grateful.

204
00:10:22,371 --> 00:10:24,540
It might get kinda hot during the summer.

205
00:10:24,624 --> 00:10:27,835
[Saki] She'd always help me come up
with solutions to any problems.

206
00:10:28,794 --> 00:10:30,046
Then, one day…

207
00:10:31,255 --> 00:10:34,342
Look, Saki, I know you've never thought
of me as the dating type.

208
00:10:35,176 --> 00:10:37,553
But, how about you give me a chance?

209
00:10:38,137 --> 00:10:41,557
