244
00:12:25,619 --> 00:12:26,620
Mori, stop.

245
00:12:27,121 --> 00:12:29,623
[Saki] What are you doing? Get off!

246
00:12:30,875 --> 00:12:31,876
[Saki gasps]

247
00:12:31,959 --> 00:12:33,043
[Mori] Why would I do that?

248
00:12:33,878 --> 00:12:37,256
Oh, come on now, Saki,
don't be such a baby.

249
00:12:37,965 --> 00:12:40,092
You agreed to come over to my place.

250
00:12:40,176 --> 00:12:42,553
You knew exactly what you were doing.

251
00:12:42,636 --> 00:12:44,555
[whimpering]

252
00:12:45,139 --> 00:12:46,557
No, I…

253
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:49,143
[suspenseful music]

254
00:12:49,935 --> 00:12:51,228
[Saki] I don't want to…

255
00:12:52,771 --> 00:12:54,523
-I just came here to study!
-[Mori grunts]

256
00:12:55,149 --> 00:12:58,152
[Saki] I don't like you like that!
This is over!

257
00:12:59,153 --> 00:13:01,238
[breathing heavily]

258
00:13:03,657 --> 00:13:08,078
[Saki] He was not at all what he appeared
to be. He was twisted and gross.

259
00:13:08,162 --> 00:13:10,080
I felt dirty just thinking about it.

260
00:13:11,165 --> 00:13:12,166
[Saki] I need a shower.

261
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:13,083
[Saki sobs]

262
00:13:13,167 --> 00:13:15,085
-[student] Good morning.
-[indistinct chatter]

263
00:13:15,669 --> 00:13:17,213
[Anzu] Morning, Saki.

264
00:13:17,296 --> 00:13:18,214
[gasps]

265
00:13:18,297 --> 00:13:19,924
Hey, morning, Anzu.

266
00:13:20,007 --> 00:13:22,009
You won't believe my morning.

267
00:13:23,302 --> 00:13:24,845
[Saki] Oh, I will wait till we're alone,

268
00:13:24,929 --> 00:13:26,722
then I can tell her
about what happened yesterday.

269
00:13:27,598 --> 00:13:30,684
Saki, is it true? Did you punch Mori?

270
00:13:30,768 --> 00:13:31,727
I…
[gasps]

271
00:13:31,810 --> 00:13:33,437
'Cause he broke up with you,

272
00:13:33,521 --> 00:13:35,731
he said you have other boys on the side.

273
00:13:35,814 --> 00:13:37,858
And that you followed him
all the way home,

274
00:13:37,942 --> 00:13:39,735
and kept begging him to take you back!

275
00:13:39,818 --> 00:13:42,655
And when he refused to let you
in the house, you punched him!

276
00:13:42,738 --> 00:13:43,739
[Saki] What?

277
00:13:43,822 --> 00:13:46,325
-[sobs]
-[students murmuring]

278
00:13:47,326 --> 00:13:50,246
[Saki] Was this my fault?
Did I lead him on?

279
00:13:50,829 --> 00:13:53,249
I should have been more upfront
about my feelings.

280
00:13:53,332 --> 00:13:57,628
But they don't even know me.
They don't know anything about me.

281
00:13:58,254 --> 00:14:02,258
All they see when they look at me
is my face, my body.

282
00:14:02,341 --> 00:14:05,553
They weren't there.
They don't know what happened.

283
00:14:05,636 --> 00:14:07,263
And now they all think I'm…

284
00:14:09,014 --> 00:14:10,266
It's obviously a lie.

285
00:14:10,349 --> 00:14:11,725
[gasps]

286
00:14:12,351 --> 00:14:14,270
Saki'd never do something like that.

287
00:14:14,853 --> 00:14:17,273
You don't know her at all,
so stop spreading rumors.

288
00:14:17,356 --> 00:14:18,691
[murmuring]

289
00:14:18,774 --> 00:14:21,151
That goes for all of you.
Knock off the gossip!

290
00:14:25,614 --> 00:14:26,490
Hey, Mori.

291
00:14:28,742 --> 00:14:29,660
Huh?

292
00:14:30,744 --> 00:14:34,665
You need to cut it out.
Spreading rumors about Saki's not cool.

293
00:14:34,748 --> 00:14:36,667
She dumped you. Get over it.

294
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:39,670
But, she's the one that punched me.

295
00:14:39,753 --> 00:14:42,756
Save it. You're not the victim here
and we both know it.

296
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,884
You're the one
who ignored her when she said no

297
00:14:44,967 --> 00:14:46,677
and tried to force yourself on her anyway.

298
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,721
-[sobbing]
-[Anzu] Did you think she wouldn't tell?

299
00:14:49,305 --> 00:14:50,806
Never underestimate her.

300
00:14:51,307 --> 00:14:52,808
Uh… uh…

301
00:14:53,309 --> 00:14:56,228
-[school bell dings]
-[sobs]

302
00:14:57,104 --> 00:14:58,814
Sounds like class is starting.

303
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:01,317
[Anzu] Oh well.

304
00:15:02,359 --> 00:15:03,611
[Saki] It had been a long time

305
00:15:03,694 --> 00:15:05,654
since I cried
in front of anyone like that.

306
00:15:06,447 --> 00:15:07,823
But those tears…

307
00:15:07,907 --> 00:15:09,241
[Saki] Anzu.

308
00:15:10,659 --> 00:15:11,827
Thanks so much.

309
00:15:12,828 --> 00:15:16,749
[Saki] They weren't sad tears.
They were tears of pure joy.

310
00:15:16,832 --> 00:15:18,834
-I had a friend who could see me.
-[chuckles]

311
00:15:20,002 --> 00:15:22,212
We're gonna be together forever, Anzu.

312
00:15:22,296 --> 00:15:23,464
Yeah, we are.

313
00:15:23,547 --> 00:15:25,549
[sentimental music]

314
00:15:25,633 --> 00:15:28,010
[snoring]

315
00:15:31,513 --> 00:15:34,016
Hey Anzu, you're the best.

316
00:15:38,395 --> 00:15:39,563
[Riri] Hey, gang!

317
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:43,025
How's your break?
Are you enjoying your summer?

318
00:15:44,276 --> 00:15:45,611
[slurping]

319
00:15:46,111 --> 00:15:49,823
And since we're talking about summer…

320
00:15:51,241 --> 00:15:53,077
-Yep! It's that time!
-[drumroll]

321
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:54,912
Summer festival season is back!

322
00:15:54,995 --> 00:15:57,039
So what are you saying?
Do you three want to go?

323
00:15:57,122 --> 00:16:00,125
I'm gonna pass.
I can't eat any of the snacks.

324
00:16:00,209 --> 00:16:01,585
Too many people there.

325
00:16:01,669 --> 00:16:04,296
You were a little too quick
to reject the idea.

326
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:05,881
Sounds like fun to me.

327
00:16:05,965 --> 00:16:06,799
Yes!

328
00:16:06,882 --> 00:16:09,093
You both really don't wanna go?

329
00:16:09,176 --> 00:16:10,719
-Oh yeah!
-[Anzu and Tsukasa] Uh…

330
00:16:12,179 --> 00:16:14,223
[Anzu] He probably just wants
to take his mind off

331
00:16:14,306 --> 00:16:16,266
his team losing the big game.

332
00:16:17,017 --> 00:16:18,143
Know what? Let's go.

333
00:16:18,727 --> 00:16:20,145
You two go without me.

334
00:16:20,229 --> 00:16:21,063
-Huh?
-Huh?

335
00:16:21,146 --> 00:16:24,692
[Anzu] We can't go alone! What if he tries
to confess his love for me?

336
00:16:24,775 --> 00:16:26,902
No! Kazuki, you have to come!

337
00:16:26,986 --> 00:16:28,612
The more the merrier, I mean it!

338
00:16:28,696 --> 00:16:30,114
Yeah, you know she's right.

339
00:16:30,197 --> 00:16:31,365
Plus, you deserve a night off

340
00:16:31,448 --> 00:16:32,658
after working all summer.

341
00:16:32,741 --> 00:16:35,577
[Junta] I won't be able to keep
my feelings secret if I'm alone with her.

342
00:16:36,870 --> 00:16:38,122
Fine, then I'll go.

343
00:16:38,205 --> 00:16:39,081
-Ah!
-Yay!

344
00:16:39,164 --> 00:16:40,958
[Anzu] And I'll invite Saki too.

345
00:16:41,041 --> 00:16:42,543
[Junta] Great.

346
00:16:42,626 --> 00:16:44,294
And we should all wear yukatas.

347
00:16:44,378 --> 00:16:46,463
It's tradition and adds to the fun!

348
00:16:46,547 --> 00:16:49,049
I don't know how to wear those.
Can't we just dress normal?

349
00:16:49,133 --> 00:16:49,967
Oh?

350
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:52,428
Yukata? I want to wear one.

351
00:16:52,511 --> 00:16:53,345
Really?

352
00:16:54,054 --> 00:16:55,931
I got this. Leave everything to me.

353
00:16:57,099 --> 00:16:59,351
[Riri] I promise it was worth the wait!

354
00:16:59,435 --> 00:17:01,937
These are so perfect, Riri! Thank you!

355
00:17:02,021 --> 00:17:04,064
-Yay!
-You're coming with us?

356
00:17:04,148 --> 00:17:04,982
Mm-hm!

357
00:17:05,065 --> 00:17:06,900
You three look wonderful.

358
00:17:07,401 --> 00:17:09,653
[Junta] How is it
Anzu looks even cuter like this?

359
00:17:09,737 --> 00:17:12,656
[Anzu] Hmm,
this really accentuates their hotness.

360
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:14,658
WATER BALLOONS

361
00:17:15,409 --> 00:17:17,661
Wow, there are so many people here.

362
00:17:18,328 --> 00:17:20,998
-Hang on, do you know where Junta went?
-[Anzu and Saki] Huh?

363
00:17:21,999 --> 00:17:22,875
[Anzu] What?

364
00:17:24,001 --> 00:17:27,963
Uh. Oh, excuse me. My fault. Pardon me.

365
00:17:28,505 --> 00:17:30,507
He'll never get through
being that polite.

366
00:17:30,591 --> 00:17:31,425
[Tsukasa sighs]

367
00:17:32,051 --> 00:17:34,678
-[Anzu] Junta!
-Oh, Anzu.

368
00:17:34,762 --> 00:17:37,931
Uh, come on.
What are you doing all the way back here?

369
00:17:38,015 --> 00:17:39,016
[gasps]

370
00:17:40,017 --> 00:17:41,435
-[gasps]
-[Anzu] Oh no.

371
00:17:41,518 --> 00:17:44,438
[in deep voice]
Don't get the wrong idea here, buddy.

372
00:17:47,274 --> 00:17:48,942
-[Anzu in normal voice] Ryuya.
-[gasps]

373
00:17:49,026 --> 00:17:51,612
Are you two on a date?

374
00:17:51,695 --> 00:17:53,697
It's gotta be a date.
You're holding hands.

375
00:17:53,781 --> 00:17:55,074
-Mm.
-Uh…

376
00:17:55,157 --> 00:17:56,784
No! I was just trying to keep Junta

377
00:17:56,867 --> 00:17:58,702
from getting lost in the crowd.
That's all.

378
00:17:59,286 --> 00:18:01,747
-Hey Anzu, these guys your friends?
-Uh…

379
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:02,706
Oh.

380
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:05,125
I know you. You were in our junior high.

381
00:18:05,209 --> 00:18:06,919
Whoa, it's Takamine.

382
00:18:07,002 --> 00:18:08,337
With a good-looking guy.

383
00:18:08,921 --> 00:18:11,256
[Anzu] See? Not a date.
We're all here together.

384
00:18:12,007 --> 00:18:13,509
-[Ryuya] Tonta.
-Huh?

385
00:18:14,093 --> 00:18:15,511
-Huh?
-Come with me.

386
00:18:15,594 --> 00:18:17,513
-[Junta] Okay.
-[Ryuya] Who's that guy?

387
00:18:18,097 --> 00:18:20,224
Uh, who? Kazuki?

388
00:18:20,307 --> 00:18:22,643
He's just a friend from school,
that's all.

389
00:18:23,227 --> 00:18:24,686
You can't be that dense!

390
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:25,729
What do you mean?

391
00:18:27,231 --> 00:18:28,732
I know I said I wouldn't give up,

392
00:18:29,399 --> 00:18:31,777
but low-key I'm kinda rooting
for you and her.

393
00:18:32,861 --> 00:18:35,948
So step up
and quit letting this pretty boy beat you!

394
00:18:36,031 --> 00:18:39,576
[Junta] Yeah, well, Kazuki's not really
looking for a girlfriend right now.

395
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,954
[Ryuya] Or so he says.
All is fair in love and war.

396
00:18:42,037 --> 00:18:44,706
Besides, when are you gonna tell her
how you feel, anyway?

397
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,708
What? Uh…

398
00:18:47,543 --> 00:18:50,879
Look, I spent three years
without seeing Anzu.

399
00:18:52,714 --> 00:18:55,342
As long as I get to hang out with her,
I'm happy.

400
00:18:56,009 --> 00:18:58,303
You know, in all those girly comics,

401
00:18:58,387 --> 00:19:01,014
the unrequited love
of a childhood friend never goes anywhere.

402
00:19:01,098 --> 00:19:02,099
[gasps]

403
00:19:02,850 --> 00:19:04,852
-Hey, what are you two talking about?
-Mm…

404
00:19:04,935 --> 00:19:07,604
The line for the shooting game is gone.
We should get going.

405
00:19:07,688 --> 00:19:09,106
Yeah, okay.

406
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:11,441
Bye! Let's hang again soon!

407
00:19:13,944 --> 00:19:15,863
Sorry, my dude,
but you don't stand a chance.

408
00:19:15,946 --> 00:19:18,490
Huh? Looks aren't everything.
She's not that shallow.

409
00:19:18,574 --> 00:19:21,243
[Sota] Yeah, I'm not sure
he's basing it on your looks.

410
00:19:21,326 --> 00:19:22,494
[Ryuya groans]

411
00:19:22,578 --> 00:19:25,455
Who knew it was so easy
to run into people at a festival.

412
00:19:26,081 --> 00:19:29,334
I wonder if any of the kids that you went
to junior high with are here.

413
00:19:29,835 --> 00:19:31,461
Doubt it. It's pretty far.

414
00:19:31,545 --> 00:19:34,756
[Anzu] That's true. They probably
wouldn't come all this way for a festival.

415
00:19:36,550 --> 00:19:37,885
-[girls giggling]
-[Tsukasa gasps]

416
00:19:37,968 --> 00:19:40,345
[heart thumping]

417
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:42,514
[Tsukasa] I know
I should have brought my hat.

418
00:19:43,849 --> 00:19:47,477
No, I can't keep hiding behind it.
I can do this.

419
00:19:47,561 --> 00:19:50,022
[breathes deeply]

420
00:19:51,273 --> 00:19:52,983
Are you getting hungry yet?

421
00:19:53,066 --> 00:19:54,943
I am! Why don't we get some dinner?

422
00:19:55,027 --> 00:19:56,862
[Junta] I can go for takoyaki.

423
00:19:56,945 --> 00:19:58,155
[Saki] I want a loaded potato.

424
00:19:58,238 --> 00:20:00,240
[Anzu] Cotton candy and a candied apple!

425
00:20:00,324 --> 00:20:01,617
[Riri] I want a lollipop!

426
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:02,826
[Tsukasa] That's not dinner.

427
00:20:03,327 --> 00:20:05,412
[Anzu] Whatever. Let's split up
and all get our own food.

428
00:20:05,495 --> 00:20:07,331
We'll meet back up for the fireworks.

429
00:20:07,414 --> 00:20:08,916
[Saki] Works for me!

430
00:20:12,002 --> 00:20:13,170
-Huh?
-Uh?

431
00:20:13,253 --> 00:20:15,130
Aren't you Kazuki's friend?

432
00:20:15,214 --> 00:20:17,424
I know, it's Makoto, isn't it?

433
00:20:17,507 --> 00:20:19,343
Yep. And you're Saki.

434
00:20:19,426 --> 00:20:20,802
Is Hosshi here with you?

435
00:20:20,886 --> 00:20:23,889
Mm. We came in a group
with Kazuki and Junta.

436
00:20:23,972 --> 00:20:26,683
Really? You're here with Hayami? So cool!

437
00:20:27,267 --> 00:20:28,769
He's even wearing a yukata.

438
00:20:28,852 --> 00:20:30,729
[Makoto] And I bet he looks great in it.

439
00:20:30,812 --> 00:20:32,481
[Saki] Are you here with anyone?

440
00:20:32,564 --> 00:20:34,816
[Makoto] Not really.
I'm my sister's gofer for the night.

441
00:20:34,900 --> 00:20:37,611
I'd come hang with you guys
but it would just piss her off.

442
00:20:37,694 --> 00:20:39,613
So, tell everyone "hi" for me.

443
00:20:39,696 --> 00:20:41,281
Mm-hm, of course.

444
00:20:41,907 --> 00:20:44,910
[Mori] Ah, there you are.
I thought you were in the other line.

445
00:20:45,452 --> 00:20:46,286
[nervous gasp]

446
00:20:46,370 --> 00:20:48,288
Oh. Hey, Saki.

447
00:20:48,872 --> 00:20:50,540
[gasps]
Why are you here?

448
00:20:51,124 --> 00:20:53,710
You know this chick? She's pretty cute.

449
00:20:53,794 --> 00:20:55,003
Yeah, she's my ex.

450
00:20:55,087 --> 00:20:57,256
-Not bad.
-Dude, I'm jealous.

451
00:20:57,923 --> 00:21:00,342
[guy] So, this guy here
your new boyfriend?

452
00:21:01,009 --> 00:21:02,010
No, he's a friend.

453
00:21:02,844 --> 00:21:04,471
Oh? So you're single?

454
00:21:04,554 --> 00:21:07,224
Don't bother. She's a real ice princess.

455
00:21:07,307 --> 00:21:08,350
[guy] Ooh.

456
00:21:08,433 --> 00:21:10,143
[whimpers]

457
00:21:10,227 --> 00:21:11,728
[Saki] Anzu, save me.

458
00:21:11,812 --> 00:21:12,938
Uh…

459
00:21:14,106 --> 00:21:15,274
Did you hear?

460
00:21:15,357 --> 00:21:18,318
The big potato stand
has five new toppings this year.

461
00:21:18,402 --> 00:21:19,236
What?

462
00:21:19,903 --> 00:21:22,364
-[Makoto] Hey Saki, let's go check it out!
-[Saki gasps]

463
00:21:23,991 --> 00:21:25,993
[somber music]

464
00:21:27,327 --> 00:21:28,370
Huh?

465
00:21:32,791 --> 00:21:35,419
[Makoto] I got the feeling
you needed a way out back there,

466
00:21:35,502 --> 00:21:37,045
sorry if I overstepped.

467
00:21:37,129 --> 00:21:38,463
Mm-mm.

468
00:21:39,923 --> 00:21:41,174
Thank you.

469
00:21:41,258 --> 00:21:44,386
And I'm sorry too.
You lost your place in line for me.

470
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:47,889
[Makoto] Yeah, it's no biggie.
I can always get back in line.

471
00:21:47,973 --> 00:21:48,890
Huh?

472
00:21:50,809 --> 00:21:53,729
Look! They really do have
new toppings this year.

473
00:21:54,229 --> 00:21:55,397
Wanna grab some food?

474
00:21:56,481 --> 00:21:57,607
Yeah.

475
00:21:59,860 --> 00:22:01,153
[Anzu] Hey!

476
00:22:01,236 --> 00:22:03,280
-You find anything good?
-Yeah.

477
00:22:03,905 --> 00:22:06,283
I guess everyone else is still in line.

478
00:22:06,366 --> 00:22:07,784
Huh?

479
00:22:09,077 --> 00:22:11,163
-[Tsukasa] You wore it.
-Huh?

480
00:22:11,246 --> 00:22:13,790
Oh, good catch!
It's the one you bought for me.

481
00:22:14,583 --> 00:22:15,792
Hmm.

482
00:22:15,876 --> 00:22:16,877
[fireworks blasting]

483
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:19,004
[crowd gasping in awe]

484
00:22:19,087 --> 00:22:20,464
Hey, it's starting.

485
00:22:22,632 --> 00:22:25,302
[fireworks crackling]

486
00:22:25,886 --> 00:22:27,804
[exclaims]

487
00:22:28,847 --> 00:22:29,806
[sighs]

488
00:22:30,682 --> 00:22:32,267
[phone clicks]

489
00:22:32,350 --> 00:22:35,020
We look so cute. I'm gonna post it now.

490
00:22:35,103 --> 00:22:37,314
Shouldn't you blur
the people in the background?

491
00:22:37,397 --> 00:22:39,524
You can't make anyone out. I'm sending.

492
00:22:39,608 --> 00:22:42,861
I know, let's take a picture together
and send it to Arisa.

493
00:22:42,944 --> 00:22:44,321
Uh, I don't want to be in it.

494
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:47,324
I bet she will get a kick
out of you in a yukata!

495
00:22:47,407 --> 00:22:49,326
-[camera clicks]
-[Anzu] Huh…

496
00:22:49,951 --> 00:22:51,620
Sorry, that took forever.

497
00:22:51,703 --> 00:22:54,831
You all made it back.
Wait, when'd you get here?

498
00:22:55,457 --> 00:22:56,416
Serendipitous.

499
00:22:57,417 --> 00:22:59,419
You're slumming in here with us commoners?

500
00:22:59,503 --> 00:23:01,922
[huffs]
Actually, the first firework shows

501
00:23:02,005 --> 00:23:03,715
were enjoyed by nobility.

502
00:23:03,799 --> 00:23:05,801
Okay…

503
00:23:05,884 --> 00:23:08,345
-Let me get a picture. Smile.
-[camera clicks]

504
00:23:08,428 --> 00:23:10,972
[tranquil music]

505
00:23:19,940 --> 00:23:21,858
[fireworks crackling]

506
00:23:25,153 --> 00:23:27,989
[Riri] Here we go.
[chuckles]

507
00:23:28,073 --> 00:23:30,367
-[gasps]
-[Junta and Tsukasa] Whoa.

508
00:23:31,201 --> 00:23:32,369
-That was close.
-Uh…

509
00:23:32,452 --> 00:23:33,328
Are you okay?

510
00:23:33,954 --> 00:23:35,914
I, uh, thanks, I'm fine.

511
00:23:36,915 --> 00:23:37,833
Wait…

512
00:23:37,916 --> 00:23:39,334
[Anzu screams angrily]

513
00:23:39,417 --> 00:23:41,461
-You did that on purpose!
-I know you loved it!

514
00:23:41,545 --> 00:23:44,339
-[Anzu] That cotton candy wasn't cheap!
-[Riri] I'll buy you another one!

515
00:23:44,422 --> 00:23:46,341
[Anzu] How dare you make me drop it!
You owe me another one!

516
00:23:46,424 --> 00:23:48,718
-Huh?
-I bought this for you.

517
00:23:48,802 --> 00:23:50,345
What? For me?

518
00:23:50,971 --> 00:23:53,348
Thank you for always taking care
of me, Tsuchiya.

519
00:23:53,431 --> 00:23:54,850
-[fireworks crackling]
-Uh…

520
00:23:56,726 --> 00:23:57,853
Stunning.

521
00:23:59,146 --> 00:24:00,397
Y-- Yes.

522
00:24:00,939 --> 00:24:04,609
[Anzu] It might have been Riri's
annoying scheme that brought us together,

523
00:24:04,693 --> 00:24:08,530
but I really hope we all can come back
and do this again next year.

524
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:12,117
[keyboard clacking]

525
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:14,119
[rattling]

526
00:24:14,202 --> 00:24:15,120
[mouse clicks]

527
00:24:15,203 --> 00:24:16,329
[Yukana] I found you.

528
00:24:19,291 --> 00:24:20,792
Tsukasa, my love.

529
00:24:23,295 --> 00:24:25,005
A fanfare, please!

530
00:24:25,088 --> 00:24:27,257
And a big congratulations!

531
00:24:27,340 --> 00:24:29,384
Did you fall for my little trick?

532
00:24:29,467 --> 00:24:32,429
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

533
00:24:32,512 --> 00:24:36,183
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

534
00:24:36,266 --> 00:24:38,935
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

535
00:24:39,019 --> 00:24:41,313
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

536
00:24:41,396 --> 00:24:43,982
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

537
00:24:44,065 --> 00:24:45,984
So I can make sure I get paid.

538
00:24:46,067 --> 00:24:48,236
[closing theme music]

539
00:24:48,320 --> 00:24:49,154
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

540
00:24:51,781 --> 00:24:52,616
♪ Let's go! ♪

541
00:24:54,743 --> 00:24:55,911
♪ Lo-love! ♪

542
00:24:58,371 --> 00:24:59,206
♪ Here we go! ♪
